324.29| 49.1   | 0.08   | 49.12  |\n| S12                 | 959.55 | 0.11   | 941.98 | 1237.42| 49.13  | 1031.86| 0.09   | 1031.07| 73.57  | 49.1   | 0.12   | 1031.53|\n\n- Each entry (i, j) is the transportation cost per unit from supplier Si to customer Cj.\n- Supplier IDs: S1–S12\n- Customer IDs: C1–C12\n\nThis matrix is the complete transportation cost data as requested.",
